Reading:
 mism=0 everywhere  => observer-source = LRC-safe exactly (by design):
   LRC = 'the observer-marked clock reaches a SOURCE class'. A pure
   marked tournament-iso-class (A000568-with-mark) reachability problem.
 mk_overlap=0       => observer-source IS a function of the marked class
   (sanity: source-ness is a marked-class invariant).
 runner_mixed>0     => loneliness is NOT a function of the UNMARKED
   runner-runner half-turn class: the half-turn sub-tournament does not
   determine loneliness (matches codex's negative result). The MARK +
   the LRC walls are exactly what carries the loneliness information.
